    "detailed_description": "Evil aliens invade Mother Russia with made of garbage war machines.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/732440/extras/cf1eefd9a442a6450912c548c6b20364.poster.avif?t=1721629276\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/732440/extras/cf1eefd9a442a6450912c548c6b20364.webm?t=1721629276\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/732440/extras/cf1eefd9a442a6450912c548c6b20364.mp4?t=1721629276\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Cities are on fire, citizens have been destroyed or ran away. But there is still a slight chance to change the outcome of this war.<br><br>A man from a ghetto. Sport suit, classic shoes, a cap. In the world of procedurally generated robots he possesses a crossbow, a gun, an AK-47, a bazooka, and an insatiable thirst for enemy blood. Or machine oil in this case. <br><br>The hero we deserve. Actually, he's the only one we've got, so there is no need for complaining. The man is here to say one thing to those mechanical bastards: &quot;This Russia is mine&quot;.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Side-scroll run'n'gun 2.5D twin-stick shooter<br></li><li> Generated levels<br></li><li> Modular enemies<br></li><li> The entire gameplay is shooting. A lot. It's pretty relaxing actually<br></li><li> Various weapons<br></li><li> Three lives to complete a level<br></li><li> More is coming during Early Access...</li></ul>",
